    title: "Sketch Additional Files gives a slot to the first README link and to the file that lists the most symbol names, whatever they are, and prints the README cut to 500 tokens while the next file goes in whole"  # 10f0
    status: todo_hard  # 10f0
    priority: 3  # 10f0
